        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Compensation for said leave shall be at average earnings as computed in Section 11E and the employee shall be granted three (3) days pay. The immediate family shall consist of the employee's spouse, children, mother, father, mother-in-law, father-in-law, sister, brother, roommate, stepparents, grandchildren, grandparents and domestic partners.",
            "block_bbox": [
                340,
                65,
