        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If the combined time spent in jury duty and work for the Employer exceeds eight (8) hours in one day, the employee is not required to work those scheduled hours which exceed the combined eight (8) hours per day. It is further understood that if the combined time of jury duty hours and work for the Employer hours exceeds forty (40) hours per payroll week, the employee is not required to work those scheduled",
